---
import SectionHeader from './SectionHeader.astro';
import Button from './Button.astro';
import CloudDivider from './CloudDivider.astro';
---

<section class="pt-16 sm:pt-24 pb-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#080b11] via-[#0a0f1d] to-[#0a0f1d] relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden pointer-events-none -z-0">
    <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/3 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[600px] h-[350px] bg-gradient-to-tr from-sky-500/10 via-indigo-500/10 to-rose-500/8 rounded-full blur-[100px]"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 pb-10 sm:pb-16">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col gap-6">
        <SectionHeader
          eyebrow="About me"
          title="Hey, I'm LUC4N3X."
          subtitle="Software developer, Linux user, and the person behind Levyra."
        />

        <div class="space-y-4 text-zinc-300 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-normal">
          <p>
            I build software for myself and keep at it until it works the way I want. Most of my time goes into Android apps, backend APIs and small self-hosted tools.
          </p>
          <p>
            Getting a feature to run the first time is usually the easy part. What I enjoy is everything after that: chasing the weird edge cases, fixing a bug that only shows up on one obscure phone, and cutting complexity until the code reads plainly.
          </p>
          <p>
            A lot of my ideas end up in Levyra, my open-source music player. When I'm not working on it, I'm usually tinkering with local-first setups, audio pipelines or small Linux utilities.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-2 border-t border-b border-white/[0.08] py-5 text-sm text-zinc-400">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-[#38bdf8] mt-0.5 font-bold text-base leading-none">·</span>
            <span>Kotlin and Jetpack Compose on Android, Python and Docker on the backend, Linux everywhere</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-[#818cf8] mt-0.5 font-bold text-base leading-none">·</span>
            <span>I test on real phones, because the strangest bugs only show up on real hardware</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-[#f43f5e] mt-0.5 font-bold text-base leading-none">·</span>
            <span>I would rather ship a small, verified fix than a big rewrite nobody has tested</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-2">
          <Button href="/about" variant="secondary" size="md">
            <span>More about how I work</span>
            <span class="ml-1">→</span>
          </Button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative flex justify-center">
        <div class="portrait relative w-full max-w-[440px] pt-10">
          <!-- Halo the portrait rises out of -->
          <div class="portrait__halo" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="portrait__ring" aria-hidden="true"></div>

          <img
            src="/assets/brand/luc4n3x-thinking.webp"
            alt="LUC4N3X thinking, hand on chin"
            width="889"
            height="900"
            loading="lazy"
            class="portrait__img relative z-10 mx-auto w-[88%]"
          />

          <div class="thought absolute right-[-4%] top-0 z-20" aria-hidden="true">
            <span>why only on <em>this</em> phone?</span>
          </div>
          <span class="thought-dot thought-dot--1" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="thought-dot thought-dot--2" aria-hidden="true"></span>

          <span class="about-sticker about-sticker--sky absolute left-[-2%] top-[38%] z-20 -rotate-[8deg]">Arch Linux &middot; Wayland</span>
          <span class="about-sticker about-sticker--pink absolute right-[0%] bottom-[16%] z-20 rotate-[6deg]">Made in Italy</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

  <CloudDivider fill="#080b11" />
</section>

<style>
  .portrait__halo {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 92%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    border-radius: 50%;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 30% 25%, rgba(255,255,255,.18), transparent 45%),
      linear-gradient(150deg, #38bdf8 0%, #6366f1 48%, #f472b6 100%);
    box-shadow: 0 40px 120px -20px rgba(99,102,241,.55);
  }
  .portrait__ring {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    bottom: -4%;
    width: 108%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,.18);
    animation: spin 60s linear infinite;
  }
  /* Head and shoulders break out of the halo; the bottom melts into it */
  .portrait__img {
    filter: drop-shadow(0 24px 30px rgba(8,11,17,.55));
    -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, #000 78%, transparent 99%);
    mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, #000 78%, transparent 99%);
  }

  .thought {
    padding: .7rem 1.1rem;
    border-radius: 1.4rem;
    background: #fff;
    color: #0b1326;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: .9rem;
    white-space: nowrap;
    box-shadow: 0 16px 30px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.6);
    animation: bob 6s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  .thought em { font-style: italic; color: #6366f1; }
  .thought-dot {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 20;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #fff;
  }
  .thought-dot--1 { right: 22%; top: 3.6rem; width: 14px; height: 14px; }
  .thought-dot--2 { right: 30%; top: 5rem; width: 8px; height: 8px; }

  .about-sticker {
    padding: .4rem .9rem;
    border: 3px solid #fff;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: .82rem;
    color: #fff;
    white-space: nowrap;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 24px -8px rgba(0,0,0,.7);
  }
  .about-sticker--sky { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0ea5e9, #2563eb); }
  .about-sticker--pink { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f472b6, #e11d48); }

  @keyframes spin { to { transform: translateX(-50%) rotate(360deg); } }
  @keyframes bob {
    0%, 100% { translate: 0 0; }
    50% { translate: 0 -6px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .thought { font-size: .78rem; right: 0; }
    .about-sticker { font-size: .72rem; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .portrait__ring, .thought { animation: none; }
  }
</style>
